              "source_locator": "case-c-scale/witness/paragraph-1"
            }
          ],
          "summary": "A witness instead says RedFox may refer to Carla V. and recalls the message at approximately 2026-03-01 11:00 UTC. The witness characterizes the time as uncertain and does not claim to have seen a verified account-owner record.",
